  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t1k_1200 provides 1k functions from ffmgep target that are below 1200 characters\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t5k provides 5k functions with no extra limitations\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tfull is the full devign dataset\n\t\n\neach has [raw, input, tokens, cpg] subfolders\nraw: original json dataset\ncpg:\n\n",
